# Session History

> Append-only durable record. `current.md` is live; this file is the memory.
> One entry per closed story and per stage transition.

---

## Template — story close

```md
## US-xxx — Title

- Stage: development
- Activities: ACT-01, ACT-02, ...
- Batch: 1 (ACT-01, ACT-04 in parallel), 2 (ACT-02), ...
- Documentation: ADR-0002, docs/planning/contracts.md, docstrings in src/...
- Tests: <what they prove>
- Gates: --activity per activity; --story green
- Approved by: <name> at <timestamp>
- Follow-ups: <new stories or open questions>
```

## Template — stage transition

```md
## PLANNING -> DEVELOPMENT

- at: <timestamp>
- approved by: <name>
- planning is closed: it cannot be re-entered.
```
